WEBVTT

00:04:28.945 --> 00:04:31.670
Bude to OK pre vás, keď zahrám 
jednu pieseň o tréme?

00:04:31.670 --> 00:04:35.032
(potlesk a jasot)

00:04:40.753 --> 00:04:43.715
Podáte mi trochu vody?

00:04:43.715 --> 00:04:47.666
(hudba)

00:04:48.143 --> 00:04:50.520
Ďakujem.

00:04:56.272 --> 00:04:58.683
♫ Nerobím si srandu, veď viete, ♫

00:04:58.683 --> 00:05:01.581
♫ táto tréma je skutočná. ♫